        {
          "text": " Jami ducu doŋ Wora otyeko miyogi woko bota; ŋat mo pe ma ŋeyo Wod, kono Won keken, dok bene ŋat mo pe ma ŋeyo Won kono Wod keken ki ŋat ma Wod oyero me nyuto Won bote. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.11.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
